{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby, then approach it, grab it and do task, otherwise scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessTask    />\"",
